{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございます‼︎\n福岡3日間ありがとう♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー全員で福岡ラーメン「shin shin」に行った時の写真だよー‼︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2017/10/19/7886089/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回，福岡シールの集合写真載せたので今回は大分シールの集合写真♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2017/10/19/7886089/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大分の景色～.＊\n緑いっぱい何もな～い♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2017/10/19/7886089/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しい楽しい。\nこんな景色普段見れないもん。\n綺麗な空気に綺麗なお水♡\n沢山吸収して帰らなくちゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今夜は，最高のライブをしてからの皆ですき焼き食べ行ってきました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2017/10/19/7886089/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味し過ぎて涙出ました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よーし‼︎\n明日は待ちに待った鹿児島だー‼︎\n気合い入れっぞ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい。。ノ"}],"source":"archive"}